# Metroid Fusion (USA, Australia): title screen to the first playable room, with no save (gate G9, route depth).
# Start at frame 200 (skips the logos), then A every 50 frames from frame 650 (title, then the long opening story, which no key shortens).
# Reached: the briefing in the Navigation Room with the sector map by about frame 18000, Samus standing in the Navigation Room with
# ENERGY 99 under her control from about frame 24000 on, still there at frame 30000 (the idle animation moves a little). Not
# reachable in 10000 frames. For the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
